<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST-Hungary's T-bill yields are seen dropping.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Hungary's T-bill yields are seen dropping.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian discount Treasury bill yields are likely to drop slightly at this week's auctions, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month T-bills on Tuesday, three-month T-bills on Wednesday, six-month bills on Thursday and 12-month bills on Friday.</p>
